<p>Dear <%= @first_name %>,</p>

<p>We need you to re-sign the <strong><%= @waiver_type_name %></strong> for <%= @child_first_name %>'s participation in <%= @event_name %>.</p>

<% if @waiver_type == :freedom_waiver %>
<p>The Freedom Waiver allows you to specify whether <%= @child_first_name %> has permission to leave the event venue unsupervised during the event.</p>
<% end %>

<p style="margin: 24px 0;">
  <%= mail_button "Complete the #{@waiver_type_name}", @portal_url %>
</p>

<p>Please complete this as soon as possible to ensure <%= @child_first_name %>'s registration is up to date.</p>

<p>If you have any questions, don't hesitate to email us at <%= mail_to @support_email %>, or just hit reply to this email!</p>
